WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.005
An idea starts with a few words.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.250
Write in live Markdown.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.015
Shape your thoughts.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.570
Keep your sources close,
without leaving the page.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.065
Find the thread across
your writing and notes.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.705
Capture a thought with local dictation.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.675
Turn fragments into an outline.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.055
Move.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.530
Nest.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.385
Move the whole branch.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:39.945
Open it again.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.385
Focus on a paragraph. Or a single sentence.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.330
Every word counts.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.725
Make time for twenty-five minutes of focus.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.255
Revisit a draft.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:58.390
Ariane. Your words. In context.
